      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COSTABIT (2) win record hardly excites but will find this more to his liking from the good gate. Snagged back from the outside draw and struck trouble in the straight before angling out late for an unlucky third over 1600m at Goulburn in C2 grade. Can race closer today and take holding out. HITCH (3) progressive colt rewarded for his consistency at start three with a tradesman-like maiden win over 1400m at Kembla Grange. Expected to run a strong 1600m and has genuine top three claims. PHILATELIC (1) has his hoof on the till and gets the services of the in-form Zac Lloyd at his fourth run back. Stalked the speed in the small field with a respectable third over 1500m at Kembla Grange. Capable on his day and sure to be thereabouts. I AM BRAVE (5) finally showed a bit of early dash to grip on and finish a tough second over 1500m at Newcastle. Ready for the mile and worth thought.",
